[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:27. Mrs. Smith's Living Room]
[00:00.560]Lesson 27. | 第27课。
[00:02.600]Mrs. Smith's living room is large. | 史密斯太太的客厅很大。
[00:06.815]There is a television in the room. | 房间里有一台电视。
[00:10.105]The television is near the window. | 电视在窗户旁边。
[00:13.505]There are some magazines on the television. | 电视机上有一些杂志。
[00:17.925]There is a table in the room. | 房间里有一张桌子。
[00:21.405]There are some newspapers on the table. | 桌子上有一些报纸。
[00:25.350]There are some armchairs in the room. | 房间里有一些扶手椅。
[00:29.130]The armchairs are near the table. | 扶手椅在桌子旁边。
[00:32.875]There is a radio in the room. | 房间里有一台收音机。
[00:36.500]The radio is near the door. | 收音机在门旁边。
[00:39.590]There are some books on the radio. | 收音机上有一些书。
[00:43.195]There are some pictures in the room. | 房间里有一些画。
[00:46.675]The pictures are on the wall. | 画在墙上。